1
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:04,925
It really has been a long time!

2
00:18:06,032 --> 00:18:07,883
I'm so happy you came by.

3
00:18:24,367 --> 00:18:26,492
Of course, watch closely!

4
00:18:41,167 --> 00:18:41,892
Like this?

5
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,388
My left hand, all the way up!

6
00:18:52,867 --> 00:18:55,692
Okay, now this one — my right hand.

7
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:58,900
See, both sides can wave!

8
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:11,362
Over there, to my left!

9
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:14,162
That way — do you see it?

10
00:19:24,664 --> 00:19:26,539
Yay, I'm glad that helped!

11
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:29,725
Let me know if you need anything else.

12
00:19:44,233 --> 00:19:44,958
Like this?

13
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:48,738
Both hands up, staying still!

14
00:20:02,103 --> 00:20:04,116
Aww, you're making me blush...

15
00:20:05,264 --> 00:20:06,396
Thank you, though!

16
00:21:02,900 --> 00:21:03,738
Here goes!

17
00:21:05,567 --> 00:21:06,192
Once...

18
00:21:07,633 --> 00:21:08,496
and twice!

19
00:21:51,567 --> 00:21:52,067
Oh!

20
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,575
I didn't know that at all.

21
00:21:55,667 --> 00:21:58,717
So like this — elbow up, hand shaking?

22
00:22:08,897 --> 00:22:10,360
Yay, I got it right!

23
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,512
I'll wave properly from now on.

24
00:22:26,467 --> 00:22:28,254
Something complicated, huh?

25
00:22:29,367 --> 00:22:30,305
Let me try...

26
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:51,975
Cross my heart, huh?

27
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:55,837
Promise — I'll always be honest with you!

28
00:23:10,633 --> 00:23:11,833
Together like this?

29
00:23:13,433 --> 00:23:15,471
A little like praying, isn't it?

30
00:23:28,433 --> 00:23:30,471
Here — hands together again.

31
00:23:31,933 --> 00:23:34,371
It feels kind of nice, actually.

32
00:23:46,933 --> 00:23:48,058
Behind myself?

33
00:23:49,767 --> 00:23:53,755
Hmm, my arms can only go this far back, I think.

34
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,875
Nod, nod, nod!

35
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:08,938
Was that three?

36
00:26:14,500 --> 00:26:15,787
Turning to my left...

37
00:26:18,100 --> 00:26:19,412
and now to my right!

38
00:26:38,367 --> 00:26:39,692
Ahh, that's better...

39
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:42,662
My shoulders were getting stiff!

40
00:26:52,297 --> 00:26:53,606
Thank you for your time!

41
00:26:54,667 --> 00:26:56,029
Was that polite enough?

42
00:27:05,633 --> 00:27:07,483
Ehehe, you're too kind.

43
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:10,312
I'm really enjoying this!

44
00:29:21,233 --> 00:29:21,833
Dance?

45
00:29:23,867 --> 00:29:25,705
Okay, just a little one!

46
00:29:35,467 --> 00:29:35,967
Oh!

47
00:29:36,900 --> 00:29:37,587
Hi there!

48
00:29:38,700 --> 00:29:41,875
I was just catching my breath — did you need something?

